Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/new-york/ulster-county"],["ARC or PLC in Ulster County","/arc-plc/new-york/ulster-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 13 grids in Ulster County came in under 90% of normal in August to September in 38 of the 75 years since 1951. On the middle of the grids, January to February ran 62% of normal in 2025, and the same pair came in at 51% so far in 2026. Grid 26324 had its driest year in 1964, at 61% of normal.</p>"}
